Tailwind Ripple accepts mainCircleSize, mainCircleOpacity, numCircles and class. Defaults are 210 pixels, 0.24 and 8. Each successive circle grows by 70 pixels, fades by 0.03 and is delayed by 0.06 seconds. The last circle has a dashed border.

Documented SolidJS example:
```tsx
import { Ripple } from "@/ui/ripple";

export default function RippleDemo() {
	return (
		<div class="relative h-[800px] w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
			<img
				src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/solidjs/solid-site/refs/heads/main/src/assets/logo.svg"
				class="w-20 grayscale"
				alt="Solid JS"
			/>
			<Ripple />
		</div>
	);
}

```

